# Keep the aos-bench build context to the nix source tree only.
# Without this, `COPY . /opt/aos` streams the whole repo (49 GB —
# dominated by a 45 GB .claude agent-worktree dir + .git), which makes
# the build take 20+ min on macOS Docker and bloats the image.
# Anchored (leading /) so the prune is root-only and BuildKit doesn't
# walk pruned subtrees (the documented unanchored-negation cost).
/.claude
/.git
/.direnv
/.idea
/output
/result
result-*
/.jj
